#: lock/lockdlg.cc:420
msgid ""
"Cannot unlock the session because the authentication system failed to work.\n"
"You must kill kdesktop_lock (pid %1) manually."
msgstr ""
"Tidak boleh mengunci sesi kerana sistem autentikasi gagal berfungsi.\n"
"Anda mesti hentikan kdesktop_lock (pid %1) secara manual."

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:518
msgid ""
"You have chosen to open another desktop session instead of resuming the "
"current one.<br>The current session will be hidden and a new login screen "
"will be displayed.<br>An F-key is assigned to each session; F%1 is usually "
"assigned to the first session, F%2 to the second session and so on. You can "
"switch between sessions by pressing CTRL, ALT and the appropriate F-key at "
"the same time."
msgstr ""
"Anda telah memilih untuk membuka sesi ruang kerja lain dan tidak menyambung "
"sesi semasa.<br>Sesi semasa akan disembunyikan dan skrin log masuk baru akan "
"dipaparkan . <br>Kekunci F ditugaskan untuk setiap sesi; F%1 biasanya untuk "
"sesi pertama, F%2 untuk sesi kedua, dan seterusnya Anda boleh bertukas sesi "
"dengan menekan serentak CTRL, ALT dan kekunci F yang dikehendaki."

